sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Feed as Market Feed (Binance / CME)
    participant MB as MicroBuffer & ChartFeed
    participant QNT as Quant Pipeline (HMM / GARCH / Ensemble)
    participant Strat as Strategy Sleeves (Crypto / US Equities)
    participant Gate as Hardened Risk Guard & Quota Manager
    participant OMS as Execution Engine / OMS
    participant Bus as EventBus & WS Manager
    participant UI as Frontend Terminal (Localhost:3000)

    %% Step 1: Market Data Ingestion & Tick Buffering
    Feed->>MB: Ingest Raw Tick / L2 Snapshot (aggTrade / quote)
    par High-Frequency Candle Processing
        MB->>MB: Aggregate into in-memory rolling OHLCV (1s/5s/1m)
        MB-->>Bus: Publish Candle Update (Dedicated Chart Channel)
        Bus-->>UI: WebSocket Frame /ws/charts (Live Candlestick Stream)
    and Feature Extraction
        MB->>QNT: Stream Tick to Microstructure (CVD, OBI, VPOC)
    end

    %% Step 2: Quantitative Regime Detection & Gating
    QNT->>QNT: Evaluate 3-State Gaussian HMM (Bull / Bear / Chop)
    QNT->>QNT: Compute GARCH(1,1) Dynamic Volatility & ATR Band
    QNT->>QNT: Run P10 Dead-Day Volume Filter
    alt Market Volume < P10 Baseline OR Chop Regime Active
        QNT-->>Strat: SUPPRESS Signals (Dead-Day / Low Liquidity Lock)
    else Regime Validated
        QNT->>Strat: Forward Regime + Volatility + Features
    end

    %% Step 3: Strategy Signal Generation
    par Crypto Sleeve (20% Allocation)
        Strat->>Strat: NFI Breakout / Funding Arbitrage / Trend Evaluation
    and US Equities Sleeve (80% Allocation)
        Strat->>Strat: 15-Min ORB / RVOL Momentum / Mean Reversion
    end
    Strat->>Gate: Emit Intent (Signal, Direction, Conviction, Target Notional)

    %% Step 4: Multi-Layer Risk & Quota Gating
    critical Pre-Trade Risk Verification
        Gate->>Gate: Check Daily Quota State (Crypto <= 20/day, Equities <= 80/day)
        Gate->>Gate: Check 4% Daily Drawdown Circuit Breaker
        Gate->>Gate: Check 18% Portfolio Max Drawdown Limit
        Gate->>Gate: Compute Dynamic Risk Budget (Strictly <= $10 USD Max Loss)
        Gate->>Gate: Calculate Dynamic Stop-Loss & Take-Profit Levels
    end

    alt Any Risk Gate Fails
        Gate-->>Bus: Publish REJECTION Audit Event (Reason, Rule ID)
        Bus-->>UI: Live Rejection Toast & Telemetry Flag
    else Risk Cleared & Quota Reserved
        Gate->>Gate: Atomically Increment Daily Quota (quota_state.json)
        Gate->>OMS: Dispatch Approved Order (Type, Symbol, Size, SL/TP)
    end

    %% Step 5: Execution & Smart Routing
    alt Simulation Mode (Paper Soak)
        OMS->>OMS: Simulated 10x Margin Engine Fill (Slippage + Latency Model)
    else Live Production Mode
        OMS->>Feed: Route to Exchange Gateway via CCXT / Alpaca
    end

    %% Step 6: Post-Trade Accounting & State Broadcast
    OMS->>OMS: Update Account Equity, Free Margin, Unrealized PnL
    OMS->>Bus: Emit ORDER_EXECUTED / POSITION_UPDATE / RISK_ALERT
    Bus->>Bus: Deduplicate State & Broadcast to /ws/trading
    Bus-->>UI: WebSocket Frame: Positions, Equity, Executed Logs, Health
    UI->>UI: React Store Update (Rerender Terminals & Risk Gauges)
